  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a bowl, mix together irish butter, lovely fresh thyme, and a pinch of salt.",
    "Add the lamb shoulder to the bowl and coat with the marinade.",
    "Thread the lamb, crisp carrots, crisp bell peppers, crisp onions, and crisp mushrooms onto skewers.",
    "Season the skewers with salt and black pepper.",
    "Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes per side, or until the lamb reaches an internal temperature of 63°C.",
